sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines<br/>Orchestrator
    participant DL as Dataset Download<br/>Component
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant PC as Parse & Chunk<br/>Component
    participant Ray as CodeFlare/Ray<br/>Distributed Compute
    participant SDG as SDG Component<br/>(SDG Hub)
    participant LLM as LLM API<br/>Endpoint
    participant FT as Fine-Tuning<br/>Component (LoRA/SFT)
    participant Deploy as Deployment<br/>Component
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>serving.kserve.io
    participant MR as Model Registry
    participant Eval as Evaluation<br/>Component

    User->>KFP: Submit Pipeline YAML
    Note over KFP: Orchestrates component<br/>execution as pods

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over KFP,S3: Data Processing Phase
        KFP->>DL: Execute dataset download
        DL->>HF: Download dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>DL: Dataset artifacts
        DL->>S3: Download from S3<br/>Auth: AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
        S3-->>DL: Data files
        DL-->>KFP: Dataset ready (PVC/S3)

        KFP->>PC: Execute parse & chunk
        PC->>Ray: Submit RayJob<br/>via ray.io API
        Note over PC,Ray: Optional Kueue quota<br/>management bypass
        Ray-->>PC: Chunked documents

        KFP->>SDG: Generate synthetic data
        SDG->>LLM: LLM inference requests<br/>Auth: LLM_API_KEY
        LLM-->>SDG: Generated data
        SDG-->>KFP: Synthetic data ready
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note over KFP,FT: Training Phase
        KFP->>FT: Execute fine-tuning<br/>(LoRA/SFT/OSFT)
        FT->>S3: Load training data<br/>Auth: S3_SECRET_KEY
        S3-->>FT: Training dataset
        FT-->>KFP: Trained model artifacts
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over KFP,MR: Deployment Phase
        KFP->>Deploy: Deploy model
        Deploy->>KServe: Create InferenceService CR
        KServe-->>Deploy: Service endpoint ready
        Deploy->>MR: Register model version
        MR-->>Deploy: Registration confirmed
        Deploy-->>KFP: Model deployed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over KFP,Eval: Evaluation Phase
        KFP->>Eval: Evaluate model
        Eval->>KServe: Inference requests<br/>to deployed model
        KServe-->>Eval: Predictions
        Eval-->>KFP: Evaluation metrics
    end

    KFP-->>User: Pipeline complete<br/>with metrics
